{title: Grande amor, sublime, eterno}
{key: Eb}

{comment: Verso 1}
[Eb]Grande amor, [Ab]sublime, [Eb]eterno,
[Bb7]Más profundo [Eb]que la mar
[Eb]Y más alto [Ab]que los [Eb]cielos,
[Eb]Insondable [Bb7]y sin [Eb]par.

{comment: Coro 1}
[Eb]Él la [Eb]puerta [Ab]abriráme
[Bb7]Y por fin entrar [Eb]podré;
[Eb]Redención Él [Ab]ha [Eb]comprado
[Eb]Y perdón [Bb7]me da por [Eb]fe.

{comment: Verso 2}
[Eb]Grande amor, [Ab]sublime, [Eb]eterno,
[Bb7]Soy indigno [Eb]pecador;
[Eb]Mas el [Eb]Hijo [Ab]incomparable
[Eb]Dio su vida [Bb7]en mi [Eb]favor.

{comment: Verso 3}
[Eb]Grande amor, [Ab]sublime, [Eb]eterno,
[Bb7]En la cruenta [Eb]cruz murió;
[Eb]Mi [Eb]bendito [Ab]Jesucristo
[Eb]Mi castigo [Bb7]así [Eb]llevó.

{comment: Verso 4}
[Eb]Cuando al [Ab]declinar [Eb]el día
[Bb7]A su puerta [Eb]llamaré,
[Eb]Con certeza [Ab]y [Eb]alegría
[Eb]Los [Eb]umbrales [Bb7]pisaré.
